OL,3,GNEWSATeenage karting champion following
OL,4,Atrack of Formula 1 heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA low hum becomes louder as an engine
OL,7,Fstarts to rev.
OL,9,FThe smell of burning tyres is in the
OL,10,Fair and crowds start to gather.
OL,12,FIt's not the practice grid of this
OL,13,Fweekend's Brazilian Grand Prix, but a
OL,14,Fschool car park where a teenager has
OL,15,Fhis sights firmly on becoming the next
OL,16,Fkarting champion to make it to Formula
OL,17,F1.
OL,19,FAs the lunchtime bell rang, most pupils
OL,20,Fmade their way to the canteen.
